"2026-08-25T20:36:05Z"},"message":"Move Cashier upgrades to composer-based, deprecate Cashier + Livewire set lists (#546)\n\n- CashierStripeOptionsToStripeRector implements ComposerPackageConstraintInterface (laravel/cashier >=13.0)\n- Cashier 13.0/14.0 method renames registered version-bound in composer-based.php\n- Deprecate CashierSetList, CashierLevelSetList, LivewireSetList, LivewireLevelSetList in favor of withComposerBased(laravel: true)\n- README: mark manual version-set section deprecated, add Cashier to composer-based coverage","tree":{"sha":"ecf056dade40ee7676623c3c3aee7d458c865133","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/git/trees/ecf056dade40ee7676623c3c3aee7d458c865133"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/git/commits/8c36a3b42fbf2b983fd1c6a2422d0af7c172b985","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjfy1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxtoQAGS9vbXhGnRw9roWswX0ZZ/6\nEspovwJkv5tfxymaxAFYixBLp+Z6CRE7RQORZszIOqDiiG2nn1o169GhoyIQyXaB\nPANe2JQ6Xn6AXBpeALBlyoQAm1ZzqstLyB4UEywMi7G30NJfRhY6eEUDq1vGPAJ0\nk7u15AoyyQCZECHEAP7YkeDlLTbEUi00GuiJqIuo71WLDuvkRY41f31lWuVsMcMM\ni1QoTR+1QPUrmWi++wl14vWnT19YTBROhpmSPpd4l8+TMUit/XoSuucRaLlpl+Ge\nC7N7D9CNoBmUngLZJUmbrafSJZjYW6ABHwysQXDkIFCuWTOXUffPAgjSFpPuPH16\nuLJ+MP8lPDUMUkekzVd2tTGS1HAEKrB4CtNQiAywmyJJX/Av5UkaFHu1q4Cdda9l\nxG3oQDiP0HSCCUjuUh9w2hdvIESnQph/5DXoHJyGMnBtAavzfDyKTqY49ydIto9s\nEIS5lb9w88tf11pr2tsNb5fm4WnBpmB8IOJhrk3QnlxoFvc8xUsLF+D7hYUREjKJ\n9H5m/Mbq+omdzYAfbo9OEBowkJboL456xPtOncR1u7QPUeaPtia3pOZAAXYPLSbQ\n0MfUX+35Ck/SlSIClHKr4YAj4TLMtWiOTtuXAWPXUfS7ZEcZWNKQFN4a8pqxTMLk\nyDoP4fJTeLjyEMZkLKfx\n=251R\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree ecf056dade40ee7676623c3c3aee7d458c865133\nparent 4646a6b9a3d216567ff3838d0f85373ea0d5574b\nauthor Tomas Votruba <tomas.vot@gmail.com> 1787690165 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787690165 -0500\n\nMove Cashier upgrades to composer-based, deprecate Cashier + Livewire set lists (#546)\n\n- CashierStripeOptionsToStripeRector implements ComposerPackageConstraintInterface (laravel/cashier >=13.0)\n- Cashier 13.0/14.0 method renames registered version-bound in composer-based.php\n- Deprecate CashierSetList, CashierLevelSetList, LivewireSetList, LivewireLevelSetList in favor of withComposerBased(laravel: true)\n- README: mark manual version-set section deprecated, add Cashier to composer-based coverage","verified_at":"2026-08-25T20:36:05Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/commits/8c36a3b42fbf2b983fd1c6a2422d0af7c172b985","html_url":"https://github.com/driftingly/rector-laravel/commit/8c36a3b42fbf2b983fd1c6a2422d0af7c172b985","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/commits/8c36a3b42fbf2b983fd1c6a2422d0af7c172b985/comments","author":{"login":"TomasVotruba","id":924196,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyNDE5Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/924196?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomasVotruba","html_url":"https://github.com/TomasVotruba","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomasVotruba/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomasVotruba/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomasVotruba/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomasVotruba/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomasVotruba/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomasVotruba/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomasVotruba/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomasVotruba/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomasVotruba/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"4646a6b9a3d216567ff3838d0f85373ea0d5574b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/commits/4646a6b9a3d216567ff3838d0f85373ea0d5574b","html_url":"https://github.com/driftingly/rector-laravel/commit/4646a6b9a3d216567ff3838d0f85373ea0d5574b"}]},{"sha":"4646a6b9a3d216567ff3838d0f85373ea0d5574b","node_id":"C_kwDOFNE1eNoAKDQ2NDZhNmI5YTNkMjE2NTY3ZmYzODM4ZDBmODUzNzNlYTBkNTU3NGI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Tomas Votruba","email":"tomas.vot@gmail.com","date":"2026-08-25T13:11:42Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-25T13:11:42Z"},"message":"Move composer-based set to single config with version-bound rule registration (#545)\n\n* use dev\n\n* misc\n\n* Move composer-based set to single config with version-bound rule registration\n\nReplace the version_compare set-import loop in config/sets/composer-based.php\nwith a single config that registers each rule directly, bound to the package\nversion that introduced it. Configurable rules use\nruleWithConfigurationComposerVersionBound(); the 25 remaining non-configurable\nRectorLaravel rules now implement ComposerPackageConstraintInterface and\nself-filter, matching the attribute rules already using it.\n\nEach converted rule test gets a composer.json fixture and provideComposerJsonFilePath()\noverride so it runs without laravel/framework installed.\n\n* coaless assign\n\n* separate configs\n\n* Deprecate version set lists in favor of withComposerBased(laravel: true)\n\n* Split AddGenericReturnTypeToRelationsRector into 3 version-bound rules, drop ApplicationAnalyzer\n\nEach rule self-filters by installed laravel/framework via ComposerPackageConstraintInterface:\n- AddLegacyGenericReturnTypeToRelationsRector  (<11.15)\n- AddNewGenericReturnTypeToRelationsRector     (>=11.15 <12.3)\n- AddGenericReturnTypeToRelationsRector        (>=12.3, keeps public name)\n\nShared logic moved to AbstractAddGenericReturnTypeToRelationsRector.\nRuntime version detection (ApplicationAnalyzer + InteractsWithLaravelVersion) removed.","tree":{"sha":"b77cb219fe828df3e84799aa1644bb07690e0ac4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/git/trees/b77cb219fe828df3e84799aa1644bb07690e0ac4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/git/commits/4646a6b9a3d216567ff3838d0f85373ea0d5574b","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjZSOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQh0QAKW+aAlpDR/5BpdrrObdbFUR\npHkx+Z3ZdbH/qDDxQXUnUrPHDzkb+0yldGUrurfLkXQ24UB60Tj5qeTy23W8smm/\nSSMkbpDs9ef5/8wcXlaGr5Hg+KxyzoTO9mt0buLY+7974tfiZuA9SMBLXOZ1Igd5\nqoSvM8h7Oys+U9EEM8UkD3vePYenb3hmSBUIDhj71+ueNCyAU01Lh6AseySssVt/\ne/B0BKpmJPtEs0tHQRXafgMxJj5NnyVq8VqTpHSt/J0TPFZcRmDTRo12S0Tpjs5F\nrv3Ntg2QsHBbppnuMxY3Hr065rgJAJZk8wK1uGSWvps8/L2F9t94VJhx2PgaPLXc\nPObdNHGAJdmOUXKZs/Kif0nWMEQ/v0nWYCjWIojTymE5UBg8MSDyUXKA46jXVDQU\nOodci8slXMqzdA3OeJQutzq1PCmpUpp5HUYfo3A59lNFWtOBX1fdOumZ9yA6rm/8\nSxVjawNB0qw8FcAk3wR5Au3povwm7/WTcXcm/Sv1G87tUHVrCMam1qH/TG/n0asg\nqaH53NyTsQsG9Twv0wMlTdPVH8iLz/I2MrnNe6pg38vGCX2vMkmmriRczDMEvucK\nltQ+26nNjhg5KhEoi3A1rZ9lOU+wwt8tQIG377opWwKaitRZseHWkdw/kR/oKZ2J\nXs7CIK/0gtsQsPy0hlps\n=GAa2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree b77cb219fe828df3e84799aa1644bb07690e0ac4\nparent f6763fe6d52af55066558c28bd23551a0ffb5b06\nauthor Tomas Votruba <tomas.vot@gmail.com> 1787663502 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787663502 -0500\n\nMove composer-based set to single config with version-bound rule registration (#545)\n\n* use dev\n\n* misc\n\n* Move composer-based set to single config with version-bound rule registration\n\nReplace the version_compare set-import loop in config/sets/composer-based.php\nwith a single config that registers each rule directly, bound to the package\nversion that introduced it. Configurable rules use\nruleWithConfigurationComposerVersionBound(); the 25 remaining non-configurable\nRectorLaravel rules now implement ComposerPackageConstraintInterface and\nself-filter, matching the attribute rules already using it.\n\nEach converted rule test gets a composer.json fixture and provideComposerJsonFilePath()\noverride so it runs without laravel/framework installed.\n\n* coaless assign\n\n* separate configs\n\n* Deprecate version set lists in favor of withComposerBased(laravel: true)\n\n* Split AddGenericReturnTypeToRelationsRector into 3 version-bound rules, drop ApplicationAnalyzer\n\nEach rule self-filters by installed laravel/framework via ComposerPackageConstraintInterface:\n- AddLegacyGenericReturnTypeToRelationsRector  (<11.15)\n- AddNewGenericReturnTypeToRelationsRector     (>=11.15 <12.3)\n- AddGenericReturnTypeToRelationsRector        (>=12.3, keeps public name)\n\nShared logic moved to AbstractAddGenericReturnTypeToRelationsRector.\nRuntime version detection (ApplicationAnalyzer + InteractsWithLaravelVersion) removed.","verified_at":"2026-08-25T13:11:43Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/commits/4646a6b9a3d216567ff3838d0f85373ea0d5574b","html_url":"https://github.com/driftingly/rector-laravel/commit/4646a6b9a3d216567ff3838d0f85373ea0d5574b","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/r